@Kelvin.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5209

GET {{Kelvin.Server_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### What the equipment is doing right now.
GET {{Kelvin.Server_HostAddress}}/api/control/state
Accept: application/json

###

### The recorded state changes, most recent first.
GET {{Kelvin.Server_HostAddress}}/api/control/history?page=1&pageSize=50
Accept: application/json

###

### Just the heating/cooling/dwell timeline for a given day.
GET {{Kelvin.Server_HostAddress}}/api/control/history?kind=Call&from=2026-07-24T00:00:00Z&to=2026-07-25T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

###

### Run times and cycle counts. Defaults to the last 24 hours when no range is given.
GET {{Kelvin.Server_HostAddress}}/api/control/stats
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Kelvin.Server_HostAddress}}/api/control/stats?from=2026-07-18T00:00:00Z&to=2026-07-25T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

###
